{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】立法會發展事務委員會今日(11月13日)舉行特別會議，討論瑪麗醫院臨床大樓升降機事故。另外，政府經濟顧問就第三季經濟表現及本地生產總值、物價預測舉行記者會。</p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:04:23.260180+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:27:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:53.412816+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:53.412816+00:00","content_hash":"d4d94b7254a1a058cd41ab60f1c4ab0ef8124d7f85ac0569c0b802a0c2b1c812","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}